sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U,DB: PHASE 1 - Create Order
    U->>FE: select customer + products
    FE->>API: POST /api/orders
    API->>DB: validate customer exists
    API->>DB: fetch product prices
    API->>DB: INSERT order (status=pending)
    API->>DB: INSERT order_items
    API-->>FE: 201 Order created
    FE-->>U: show order summary

    Note over U,DB: PHASE 2 - Confirm + Deduct Stock
    U->>FE: click Confirm Order
    FE->>API: PATCH /api/orders/id/status
    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    loop each order item
        API->>DB: check stock >= quantity
        alt insufficient stock
            API->>DB: ROLLBACK
            API-->>FE: 400 Insufficient stock
        else OK
            API->>DB: UPDATE product stock
            API->>DB: INSERT inventory_movement
        end
    end

    API->>DB: UPDATE order status=confirmed
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>FE: 200 Order confirmed
    FE-->>U: show updated status
